Software regression checks (Node.js .cjs files)

motion: requests, ramps, mode guards and timeouts.
controller: PID/motor mixing, limits, dead zones and lifecycle.
web_ui: rendered page controls, settings and distance calibration.
calibration: saved upright target and failure handling.
pid_settings / pid_library: tuning/persistence and PID calculation.
protocol: command routing and telemetry schema.
distance_reference: fresh sensor reference, persistence, pause/resume and failures.
render_page is a test helper, not firmware.

Hardware, timing and storage are mocked. These do not prove physical stability.
Motion fixtures use controlled sample trims/timings; they do not override the firmware configuration.
